WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,300
This will be our new home from now on

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,040
Jiuer, go in and take a look

3
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,160
If you need anything, just tell me

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,480
I'll prepare it

5
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:08,800
Don't worry, Master

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,160
Leave everything to me

7
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,310
In just three days

8
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,360
The whole house was clearly arranged by him

9
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:20,190
I just need to run errands every day.

10
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:22,860
Jiu'er, I'm going out first

11
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,230
Master, wait a minute

12
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:26,030
Master, why don't you wait for me?

13
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:27,350
Let me help you wash up

14
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,320
I have hands and feet, I can do it myself

15
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,000
And you’re tired all day long. There’s no need.

16
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,640
I'm not tired. I'm happy to be able to serve you.

17
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:36,840
Otherwise

18
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,800
Help me slut a few maids

19
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,000
let them help you

20
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:42,120
This way you can take some time to take care of me

21
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:43,620
No

22
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:46,260
Jiu'er doesn't disagree with you, young master, finding a new maid.

23
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:49,180
It's just that we just came here and everything is not familiar yet.

24
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:54,450
Is it better to wait for a while for this kind of thing?

25
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:58,590
Okay, then it will take some time
